<title>HONG KONG: SQUASH-HONG KONG OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-HONG KONG OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the Hong Kong Open on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding): 1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Mark Cairns (England) 15-10 15-6 15-7</p>
<p>Anthony Hill (Australia) beat Dan Jenson (Australia) 15-9 15-8 15-17 17-15</p>
<p>4-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat 7-Chris Walker (England) 15-8 15-13 13-15 15-9</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Derek Ryan (Ireland) 15-6 15-9 11-15 15-10.</p>
</text>
